# The only container variables the SPA's `/config.json` may carry, one per line: the variable's
# name, then the key it gets in the file. Everything here is sent to every visitor's browser, so
# list a public value only, never a secret. `tests/spa-runtime-config.test.ts` rejects names that
# look like secrets. See docs/stack.md, "Runtime configuration".
SPA_ENV env
SPA_ERROR_REPORT_DSN errorReportDsn
# Module switches (apps/spa/src/modules.ts, ADR 003). Unset means on; `false` turns one off.
SPA_REALTIME realtime
SPA_OFFLINE offline
# The public demo (docs/demo.md): `true` shows the demo line on the sign-in and sign-up pages.
SPA_DEMO demo
# Guest accounts (docs/guests.md): `false` hides "Try it now"; unset or anything else shows it.
SPA_GUEST guest
# The public website's host (MPA_DOMAIN), such as `www.example.com`: the legal pages the line under
# "Try it now" links to. Unset: the line names them without links.
SPA_SITE site
